From 137db0271b657622a239465c90ba12d1e0e07826 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: absol89 <absol89@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:12:23 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix: "Global stranger names" checked hides non-party names,
 invites included

The checkbox was inverted: checked now turns players outside your party
into "Stranger" (default off shows names). It is stored under a new key so
earlier saved values are not misread.

The party invite toast follows the same rule as the player list, so it no
longer reveals a name that is hidden globally or with the eye.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
